++block {"id":"showcase-1","type":"heading-1"}++
# Orbium block showcase

++block {"id":"showcase-2","type":"paragraph"}++
Summary: Demonstrates native V3 body formatting; depends on the active V3 importer and optional separate account CSS. Import the companion CSS separately through **Settings → Editor styles** for account-wide styling.

++block {"id":"showcase-3","type":"heading-2"}++
## Text and colors

++block {"id":"showcase-4","type":"paragraph"}++
A **bold**, *italic*, ~~struck~~ paragraph with `inline code` and an [ordinary link](https://example.com).

++block {"id":"showcase-5","type":"paragraph"}++
:orbium[Theme-aware blue]{"color":"preset:blue"} and :orbium[underlined amber]{"color":"preset:amber","underline":true}.

